  "$purpose": "Provenance for this copy of the Rocketpod starter kit: which kit version and commit it came from, the rename applied to it, and the manifest of replaceable surfaces. `pnpm kit:upgrade` and the /rp-upgrade skill read this file to port later kit improvements forward without recreating anything you deleted.",
  "$doNotDelete": "Deleting or renaming this file breaks upgrades. Recovering it means working out by hand which kit commit you started from and running `node scripts/upgrade.mjs --adopt <ref>`. It holds no secrets and is safe to commit.",
  "kit": {
    "id": "rocketpod",
